# `p256_signature_from_der`

In [`std/crypto`](index.hmd).

```hql
fn p256_signature_from_der(self: Bytes) : Option<Bytes>
```

The `r || s` form of an ASN.1 DER ECDSA P-256 signature, as OpenSSL
writes one, or `none` where `self` is not one.
<!-- hql reference: end -->
